/S /H2
/P 145 0 R
/T (Fast forward a few years, I did my composite allergen panel blood test and became aware of even more allergens. It was moderately expensive and in hindsight I realise how privileged I was to have undergone the test. It is unfortunate that diagnosis of allergens is also a function of privilege. While a cheaper option exists, it takes a toll on the person concerned. This involves trying out different potential allergens and maintaining a food journal to identify the specific allergens that affect the person concerned. However, even food journaling as a method of allergen identification is in its nascent stage. Earlier, people would go through a brutal process: a technician would prick the person one-by-one with each potential allergen from a comprehensive panel; then, the reaction would be observed to identify the specific allergens. )
/E (Fast forward a few years, I did my composite allergen panel blood test and became aware of even more allergens. It was moderately expensive and in hindsight I realise how privileged I was to have undergone the test. It is unfortunate that diagnosis of allergens is also a function of privilege. While a cheaper option exists, it takes a toll on the person concerned. This involves trying out different potential allergens and maintaining a food journal to identify the specific allergens that affect the person concerned. However, even food journaling as a method of allergen identification is in its nascent stage. Earlier, people would go through a brutal process: a technician would prick the person one-by-one with each potential allergen from a comprehensive panel; then, the reaction would be observed to identify the specific allergens. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
