/E (This lays down a more holistic criteria for the definition of disability: participation in society that is full, effective and on an equal basis. This definition is enshrined in the UN Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities \(UNCRPD\), which India ratified in 2007. Furthermore, the preamble to RPwD 2016 asserts that its purpose is to give effect to the UNCRPD. However, the previous comparative legal analysis shows that the views and interpretations of the Indian panel that are in contravention to the UNCRPD result in an enforcement that is only in letter! )
/Pg 20 0 R
