343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (Diversity sounds great on paper, but in reality, it creates friction. The problem is that this friction isn't shared equally. A student waiting for assistive technology might lose weeks of study time. To the university,  that's a "procedural delay." To the student, that's their future hanging in the balance. It's a strange paradox: the people who have been left out the longest are the ones we ask to be the most "understanding" when things move slowly. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [7]
>>
