/P 163 0 R
/E (Care work, though foundational to society, is undervalued. Strengthening social inclusion requires recognizing caregivers as stakeholders. Support groups, respite care services, skill training, and financial assistance can reduce burnout and restore agency. When caregivers are supported, persons with disabilities receive better care, and families become more resilient. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
