/Next 1442 0 R
>>
endobj
1439 0 obj
<<
/Title (It is to be recognised that variations in humans is ordinary and not exceptional. Support needs to be understood as participation and not privilege.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1443 0 R
/Next 1437 0 R
>>
endobj
1440 0 obj
<<
/Title (However, a toddler that could not speak up for himself would be the one paying the price for others' lack of basic understanding - let alone empathy.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1438 0 R
/Next 1444 0 R
>>
endobj
1441 0 obj
<<
/Title (Fast forward a few years, I did my composite allergen panel blood test and became aware of even more allergens. It was moderately expensive and in hindsight I realise how privileged I was to have undergone the test. It is unfortunate that diagnosis of allergens is also a function of privilege. While a cheaper option exists, it takes a toll on the person concerned. This involves trying out different potential allergens and maintaining a food journal to identify the specific allergens that affect the person concerned. However, even food journaling as a method of allergen identification is in its nascent stage. Earlier, people would go through a brutal process: a technician would prick the person one-by-one with each potential allergen from a comprehensive panel; then, the reaction would be observed to identify the specific allergens.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1438 0 R
/Prev 1444 0 R
>>
endobj
1442 0 obj
<<
/Title (This process was extremely dehumanising whereby the person would be reduced to a mere test subject)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1438 0 R
/First 1445 0 R
/Last 1446 0 R
/Count -3
/Next 1447 0 R
>>
endobj
1443 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1448 0 R
/Next 1439 0 R
>>
endobj
1444 0 obj
<<
/Title <>
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1438 0 R
/Prev 1440 0 R
/Next 1441 0 R
>>
endobj
1445 0 obj
<<
/Title (and have to undergo a traumatic experience. At times, such procedures would lead to life-threatening allergic reactions that would necessitate the administration of epinephrine and being placed under observation at an ICU. Hence, it is a matter of immense privilege to have been able to afford to simply identify my allergens while bearing minimal suffering.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1442 0 R
/Next 1449 0 R
>>
endobj
1446 0 obj
<<
/Title (Hence, eating out with food allergies is also a function of privilege.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1442 0 R
/Prev 1449 0 R
>>
endobj
1447 0 obj
<<
/Title (Such a lack of affordable options, restricts the mobility of people with food allergies.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1442 0 R
/Next 1450 0 R
>>
endobj
