>>
endobj
1449 0 obj
<<
/Title (For years, I had a difficult time dining-out due to the lack of allergy awareness and sensitivity at food joints in Mumbai and across most of India. There have been enough incidents wherein the staff even at a five-star hotel or a fine-dine was unable to cater adequately and caused a mishap. Fortunately, this has changed over the past few years as there has been increasing awareness and sensitivity.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1442 0 R
/Prev 1445 0 R
/Next 1446 0 R
>>
endobj
