/Title (I endeavour to do exactly that in pitching a solution that checks this criteria and is compatible with the Indian institutional framework. I propose broadening the purview of RPwD 2016 without causing any significant increase in the costs that it imposes. This could be achieved by establishing a new nomenclature for disability with the intensity of deprivation \(capabilities affected\) being the distinguishing criteria.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1452 0 R
/Next 1456 0 R
>>
endobj
