1458 0 obj
<<
/Title (For example, under the current regime benefits provided to persons with disabilities include but are not limited to reservation in government jobs and premier educational institutions across the country; I believe that my individual circumstances do not warrant me such special considerations. However, flexibility in attendance at educational institutions as already envisaged under RPwD is a benefit that could be extended to someone like me. I am aware of someone who is asthmatic and was low on attendance as they had to stay at home to nebulise frequently. However, the college insisted that they rather nebulise in college so as to attend regularly. This demonstrates complete apathy. We must introspect what passes off as inclusion and whether it is truly enough?)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1456 0 R
/Next 1457 0 R
>>
endobj
